      "source_summary": {
        "content": "Several riders reported incorrect fare charges during yesterday's Green Line service interruption caused by a track inspection. Verify the incident duration and affected trips, process refunds for impacted customers with journey IDs JRN-456 through JRN-460, and attach the inspection report to the incident file before notifying these riders about their refunds via email.",
        "role": "user"
      }
    },
    {
      "operation_id": "test:525:4",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_summary": {
        "content": "The Green Line service interruption due to track inspection lasted from 7:30 AM to 11:15 AM. I'll proceed by selecting incident ID INC-78901 for further actions.",
        "role": "agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "operation_id": "test:525:5",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_summary": {
        "content": "Confirming the Green Line incident for refund processing: I've selected incident ID INC-78901 for the track inspection service interruption.",
        "role": "user"
      }
    },
    {
      "operation_id": "test:525:6",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_summary": {
        "content": "Refund processing cannot proceed because the journey IDs JRN-456 through JRN-460 fall outside the incident window of 7:30 AM to 11:15 AM, and createPaymentRequest doesn't support refund transactions. Additionally, current tools can't convert journey IDs to customerIDs - I recommend manual handling for this case. Please provide the track inspection report file data so I can upload it to incident record INC-78901 for documentation.",
        "role": "agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "operation_id": "test:525:8",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_summary": {
        "content": "Here is the base64 encoded track inspection report file data: base64_encoded_report_content",
        "role": "user"
      }
    },
    {
      "operation_id": "test:525:9",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_summary": {
        "action": "{\"name\": \"uploadIncidentEvidence\", \"arguments\": {\"incidentId\": \"INC-78901\", \"files\": [\"base64_encoded_report_content\"]}}",
        "role": "agent",
        "thought": "I'll now upload the provided track inspection report as evidence for incident INC-78901 since the user has supplied the file data."
      }
    },
    {
      "operation_id": "test:525:11",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_summary": {
        "content": "I cannot send automated notifications for journeys JRN-456 to JRN-460 because these trips occurred outside the incident window (7:30 AM to 11:15 AM) and were ineligible for refunds. Since refund details are unavailable and no tool exists to retrieve rider contact information, please notify these customers manually via email.",
        "role": "agent"
      }
